'''arratel''' (ȧr-rä′tel), ''n.'' [Pg.: see ''arrel.''] The Portuguese pound. {{smaller|It exceeds the pound avoirdupois by about one per cent. The following are the values in grams: Pound avoirdupois, 453.593; arratel, in Lisbon, 459; in Funchal, 458.547; in Rio de Janeiro, 458.75.}}

